on County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 42% of normal in August to September and 49% in September to October. Grid 22942 had its driest year in 1953 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
